ing) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous choices to make</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large cast of colourful characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely original character and background art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two adorable childhood friends you can date (and one you can't)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways of getting yourself killed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422290/extras/e9f3013f87c5f4d49575ee674cb47c44.avif?t=1749238202\" width=800 height=790 /></span></p>",
